                data-prompt-target="prompt-text-1"
              >
                <span>Salin Prompt</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <pre id="prompt-text-1" class="text-[11px] font-mono-code text-[var(--text-muted)] p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-card)] border border-[var(--border-main)] whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed select-all">Build a modern, high-converting B2B commercial vehicle hero section for an authorized truck dealership (Astro/React with Tailwind CSS).
Requirements:
1. Two-column desktop grid (55% left content, 45% right image showcase) that gracefully stacks on mobile.
2. Left column: Euro4 badge pill, high-impact headline ("Armada Truk Tangguh untuk Bisnis Skala Besar"), dual CTA buttons (Primary: Red "Lihat Line Up Unit", Secondary: Outline "Konsultasi Spesifikasi Karoseri").
3. Right column: Responsive truck visual container with a floating glassmorphic Trust Badge in the bottom-left corner.
4. Trust Badge anatomy: 4px primary-colored left border accent, consultant avatar photo, consultant name ("Elgin Marchlouis"), official certified sales badge, and an animated green pulsing dot indicating "Online - Fast Response".
5. Mobile optimization: On mobile viewport, hide the floating badge from the image and dock primary CTAs to the bottom.</pre>
          </div>

          <!-- Prompt 2: Mobile Sticky Bottom Action Bar with Safe Area -->
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-main)] bg-[var(--bg-main)]">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono-code font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                PROMPT 2: Sticky Mobile Bottom Action Bar (Safe-Area Aware & Fitts's Law)
              </span>
              <button 
                class="copy-prompt-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-main)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] hover:border-emerald-500 text-xs font-mono-code text-[var(--text-main)] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5"
                data-prompt-target="prompt-text-2"
              >
                <span>Salin Prompt</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <pre id="prompt-text-2" class="text-[11px] font-mono-code text-[var(--text-muted)] p-3 rounded-lg bg-[var(--bg-card)] border border-[var(--border-main)] whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed select-all">Create a production-ready Sticky Mobile Bottom Action Bar for a commercial website using Tailwind CSS and native CSS.
Requirements:
1. Visibility: Only visible on mobile/tablet viewports (hidden on desktop md:hidden).
2. Layout: Fixed position at the bottom of viewport with z-index 50, containing 2 action buttons in a grid (Call Sales & Chat WhatsApp).
3. Ergonomics & Accessibility: Minimum button touch-target height of 44px (Fitts's Law compliant) with bold icons and text.
4. iOS Safe-Area Awareness: Use `padding-bottom: max(16px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom))` so that the action bar never collides with the iPhone home indicator gesture bar.
5. Telemetry / Attribution preservation: The WhatsApp button must preserve Google Ads click IDs (?gclid=) from localStorage in the outbound wa.me prefilled message link.</pre>
